# Every pull request needs a review from the maintainers.
#
# GitHub reads this file from the repository root, .github/ or docs/. It lives
# at the root here so that it is visible to anyone browsing the tree rather than
# hidden in a dot directory.
*                       @nabla-authors/maintainers

# The autodiff core is the part of this package that everything else trusts.
# A wrong vjp is silent, so these files get a second, narrower set of eyes.
/src/nabla/tensor.py    @nabla-authors/autodiff
/src/nabla/grad.py      @nabla-authors/autodiff
/src/nabla/ops/         @nabla-authors/autodiff

# The decisions, and the things that are true because of them. A change here is
